function updateNocturnal(){const date=$('#nocturnalDate').value?new Date(`${$('#nocturnalDate').value}T12:00:00`):new Date(),time=$('#nocturnalTime').value||'22:00',result=drawNocturnal(date);$('#nocturnalDateOut').textContent=date.toLocaleDateString('en-GB',{day:'2-digit',month:'short',year:'numeric'}).toUpperCase();$('#nocturnalTimeOut').textContent=time;$('#siderealReadout').textContent=`${Math.floor(result.lst/15)}h ${Math.floor(result.lst%15*4)}m`;$('#nocturnalDayReadout').textContent=`${Math.floor((Date.UTC(date.getFullYear(),date.getMonth(),date.getDate())-Date.UTC(date.getFullYear(),0,0))/86400000)} / ${date.getFullYear()}`}
